        "type": "note",
        "text": "Since then other languages deciphered: Palaic, Cuneiform Luvian (cuneiform), Hieroglyphic Luvian (native hieroglyphic) = second millenia; Lycian, Lydian (first millennium, Greek derived alphabet); Carian, Pisidian, and Sidetic poorly known;",
